name: sim.setJointTargetForce
description: Sets the force or torque that a joint can exert
luaSynopsis: sim.setJointTargetForce(int objectHandle, float forceOrTorque)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setJointTargetForce(int objectHandle, float forceOrTorque, bool signedValue = true)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the joint object
2. forceOrTorque: maximum force or torque the joint can exert
3. signedValue: if true, the sign of the force/torque indicates the desired movement direction
outputs:
